env       : default
VM        : box (running)
image     : img
base      : ref.default (base:box)
root      : TMP -> /work
data dir  : TMP/data
keeps     : ~/.claude, ~/.claude.json, ~/.config/caboose, ~/.config/git, ~/.config/jj, ~/.config/gh, ~/.ssh (in TMP/data/home)
isolation : vm (the default: config.toml defines no profile)
outbound  : through this machine, so its VPN routes and DNS apply (egress on; egress_ports "22 80 443")
version   : VERSION
daemon    : not running (daemon-VERSION); any caboose command that launches or links starts it, or run: caboose daemon restart
web       : unknown (the daemon is not running or does not answer)
app       : unknown (the daemon is not running or does not answer)
link      : not running (the daemon is not running); run: caboose daemon restart
claude    : 
timezone  : UTC (host: unknown)
dockerd   : in the VM, its own, not this machine's (images kept in TMP/data/vm/volumes/docker.img)
platform  : linux-arm64
local dir : TMP/data/local/linux-arm64
ssh agent : not forwarded (the host had no agent when the VM was created)

tmux sessions:

registered Claude Code sessions:

disk used by installed claude versions (retaining 2):
